# Citation metadata for archived release 1.0.0, before the EGIF migration.
# The development snapshot has no new version DOI yet.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the preferred-citation
  information.

type: dataset
title: Grandes incendios forestales en España
abstract: >-
  Dataset of 449 large forest fires in Spain with at least 500 hectares of
  forest area burned, dated between 27 February 2010 and 26 September 2026.
  Compiled and adapted from MITECO final statistics for 2010–2021 and
  provisional reports for 2022–2026. Each record includes municipality and
  province names, INE codes, date and forest area burned in hectares.
  Dates in 2012 identify the year only. The dataset does not provide complete
  annual coverage or real-time monitoring. Code and documentation use the MIT
  license; data reuse follows the MITECO legal notice.

